source: tests/cli/invariants.rs
expression: help(args)
---
Show or change configuration

Usage: work config [OPTIONS]
       work config <COMMAND>

Commands:
  path     Show the config file location and whether it exists
  default  Set the default domain (asks when omitted)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --edit  Open the config file in your editor
  -h, --help  Print help
